PRIVACY POLICY

The game does not collect any data except location information.
The game contain ads provided by Google AdMob, the ads are non-targeted, non-personalized 
so only contextual data like the user's current location, the app's content are shared with Google AdMob.
Google AdMob retains some user data even with non-personalized ads,
primarily for purposes like ad frequency capping, fraud prevention,
and aggregated reporting. However, it does not use past user behavior for ad targeting. 
The data is deleted based on the specific report type and its retention policy, which can vary
(e.g., User Activity reports are retained for 90 days, while Ads Activity reports are retained for 7 years)
